    "why": "PROJ's default EPSG:6341 (NAD83(2011) UTM 12N) -> EPSG:4326 is a null datum transformation; the 3DEP and NAIP ImageServers apply a real NAD83(2011)->WGS84 shift. Measured by phase correlation of hillshades against mdrs_area_3dep.tif in 4 windows (spread 0.03 m E, 0.05 m N) and applied so this file lines up with route_area_3dep.tif / mdrs_area_3dep.tif / *_naip2024.tif. Residual after the shift: <= 0.16 m in 10 test windows. For comparison PROJ's time-dependent 'ITRF2014 to NAD83(2011)' gives -1.30 m E, +0.46 m N at epoch 2018.3."
